Table full name: MITELMAN.PROD.KARYCLONE
Column name: CloneLength Type: NUMBER Description: length of clone description string -- usually between 8 and 24 characters, but can be up to 2199 characters
Column name: CaseNo Type: TEXT Description: case number, usually between 1 and 10, but can also be an arbitrary string, eg 'A11'
Column name: ChromoMin Type: NUMBER Description: most common values are between '42' and '51', but minimum value is '0' and maximum is '409'
Column name: CloneLong Type: TEXT Description: usually blank, but if the clone description is very long, that string will be stored here
Column name: CloneShort Type: TEXT Description: shorter, sometimes truncated clone description, eg '45,X,-Y' or '46,Xy,t(8;21)(q22;q22)'
Column name: InvNo Type: NUMBER Description: investigation number, between 1 and 9
Column name: RefNo Type: NUMBER Description: reference number, eg '14620'
Column name: CloneNo Type: NUMBER Description: clone number, between 1 and 58
Column name: ChromoMax Type: NUMBER Description: most common values are between '43' and '52', but minimum value is '0' and maximum is '409'
Column name: Sole Type: TEXT Description: T/F flag indicating whether or not this is the sole abnormality
Sample rows:
[{'RefNo': 4018, 'CaseNo': '33', 'InvNo': 1, 'CloneNo': 6, 'ChromoMin': 45, 'ChromoMax': 45, 'CloneShort': '45,X,-X', 'CloneLong': None, 'CloneLength': 7, 'Sole': 'T'}, {'RefNo': 11389, 'CaseNo': '8', 'InvNo': 1, 'CloneNo': 5, 'ChromoMin': 45, 'ChromoMax': 45, 'CloneShort': '45,X,-X', 'CloneLong': None, 'CloneLength': 7, 'Sole': 'T'}, {'RefNo': 5150, 'CaseNo': '18', 'InvNo': 1, 'CloneNo': 5, 'ChromoMin': 45, 'ChromoMax': 45, 'CloneShort': '45,X,-Y', 'CloneLong': None, 'CloneLength': 7, 'Sole': 'T'}, {'RefNo': 5898, 'CaseNo': '1', 'InvNo': 1, 'CloneNo': 13, 'ChromoMin': 45, 'ChromoMax': 45, 'CloneShort': '45,X,-Y', 'CloneLong': None, 'CloneLength': 7, 'Sole': 'T'}, {'RefNo': 6027, 'CaseNo': '1', 'InvNo': 1, 'CloneNo': 7, 'ChromoMin': 45, 'ChromoMax': 45, 'CloneShort': '45,X,-Y', 'CloneLong': None, 'CloneLength': 7, 'Sole': 'T'}]

--------------------------------------------------
Table full name: MITELMAN.PROD.MOLBIOLCLINASSOC
Column name: GeneShort Type: TEXT Description: gene symbol(s), eg 'BCR/ABL1', or 'IGH+', etc
Column name: GeneLength Type: TEXT Description: length of gene string -- usually an integer between 0 and 15
Column name: RefNo Type: NUMBER Description: reference number, eg '15563'
Column name: Topo Type: TEXT Description: topography code, eg '0401'
Column name: KaryShort Type: TEXT Description: short or truncated karyotype string, eg 't(19;19)(p13;p13)' or '+12,+19'
Column name: MolClin Type: TEXT Description: this flag indicates whether this row describes a molecular 'M' or clinical 'C' association
Column name: KaryLength Type: NUMBER Description: length of karyotype description string (up to 569)
Column name: InvNo Type: NUMBER Description: investigation number, usually between 1 and 10
Column name: Immunology Type: TEXT Description: immunology flag, usually blank, other values are 'B' or 'T'
Column name: Morph Type: TEXT Description: morphology code, eg '3111'
Column name: GeneLong Type: TEXT Description: this field is always blank (never needed)
Column name: KaryLong Type: TEXT Description: blank or long karyotype description
Sample rows:
[{'MolClin': 'C', 'RefNo': 2993, 'InvNo': 1, 'Morph': '1501', 'Topo': ' ', 'Immunology': ' ', 'GeneLength': None, 'GeneShort': None, 'GeneLong': None, 'KaryLength': None, 'KaryShort': None, 'KaryLong': None}, {'MolClin': 'C', 'RefNo': 2994, 'InvNo': 1, 'Morph': '1602', 'Topo': ' ', 'Immunology': ' ', 'GeneLength': None, 'GeneShort': None, 'GeneLong': None, 'KaryLength': None, 'KaryShort': None, 'KaryLong': None}, {'MolClin': 'C', 'RefNo': 3579, 'InvNo': 1, 'Morph': '1602', 'Topo': ' ', 'Immunology': ' ', 'GeneLength': None, 'GeneShort': None, 'GeneLong': None, 'KaryLength': None, 'KaryShort': None, 'KaryLong': None}, {'MolClin': 'C', 'RefNo': 3972, 'InvNo': 1, 'Morph': '1602', 'Topo': ' ', 'Immunology': ' ', 'GeneLength': None, 'GeneShort': None, 'GeneLong': None, 'KaryLength': None, 'KaryShort': None, 'KaryLong': None}, {'MolClin': 'C', 'RefNo': 4536, 'InvNo': 1, 'Morph': '5102', 'Topo': '0801', 'Immunology': ' ', 'GeneLength': None, 'GeneShort': None, 'GeneLong': None, 'KaryLength': None, 'KaryShort': None, 'KaryLong': None}]

--------------------------------------------------
Table full name: MITELMAN.PROD.CYTOGEN
Column name: RefNo Type: NUMBER Description: reference number (but treated as a string)
Column name: PrevTreat Type: TEXT Description: one or more characters indicating previous treatment type(s), eg 'C', or 'C,R', or 'R,S' (or blank)
Column name: SpecObs Type: TEXT Description: unknown/unnecessary field -- always blank
Column name: PatientID Type: TEXT Description: unknown/unnecessary field -- always blank
Column name: PatientName Type: TEXT Description: unknown/unnecessary field -- always blank
Column name: PrevTopo Type: TEXT Description: topology code (eg '0401') for previous-tumor (frequently blank)
Column name: Immunology Type: TEXT Description: most frequently blank, otherwise 'B' or 'T'
Column name: Race Type: TEXT Description: one of 'W', 'A', 'B', or 'O' (or blank)
Column name: Morph Type: TEXT Description: morphology code, eg '1602'
Column name: Age Type: NUMBER Description: can be blank, otherwise an integer between 0 and 100
Column name: SpecMorph Type: TEXT Description: specific morphology, eg 'Aplastic anemia', or 'AML with cup-like nuclei'
Column name: CaseNo Type: TEXT Description: case number (usually a number, but can be a string, therefore treating as string)
Column name: Topo Type: TEXT Description: topology code, eg '0902'
Column name: Sex Type: TEXT Description: one of 'M', 'F', or blank
Column name: Country Type: TEXT Description: country code, eg '3020'
Column name: Series Type: TEXT Description: one of 'U', 'S', or 'D' (never blank)
Column name: HerDis Type: TEXT Description: hereditary disease code (eg '110')
Column name: CaseOrder Type: NUMBER Description: unknown integer field between 0 and 991807
Column name: PrevMorph Type: TEXT Description: morphology code (eg '3111') for previous-tumor (frequently blank)
Column name: Origin Type: TEXT Description: blank about half the time, otherwise 'L'
Column name: SpecHerDis Type: TEXT Description: specific hereditary disease, eg 'Fanconi anemia' or 'inv(9)(p11q13)'
Column name: PrevTum Type: TEXT Description: previous-tumor flag, either blank or 'Y'
Sample rows:
[{'RefNo': 223, 'CaseNo': '1', 'Sex': 'M', 'Age': 60, 'Race': 'W', 'Series': 'S', 'Country': '3020', 'PrevTum': ' ', 'PrevMorph': None, 'PrevTopo': None, 'PrevTreat': None, 'HerDis': None, 'SpecHerDis': None, 'Morph': '1010', 'SpecMorph': None, 'Topo': ' ', 'Immunology': None, 'SpecObs': None, 'Origin': ' ', 'PatientID': None, 'PatientName': None, 'CaseOrder': 1}, {'RefNo': 427, 'CaseNo': '2', 'Sex': 'F', 'Age': 2, 'Race': None, 'Series': 'S', 'Country': '5270', 'PrevTum': ' ', 'PrevMorph': None, 'PrevTopo': None, 'PrevTreat': None, 'HerDis': None, 'SpecHerDis': None, 'Morph': '1010', 'SpecMorph': None, 'Topo': ' ', 'Immunology': None, 'SpecObs': None, 'Origin': ' ', 'PatientID': None, 'PatientName': None, 'CaseOrder': 2}, {'RefNo': 428, 'CaseNo': '1', 'Sex': 'M', 'Age': 76, 'Race': None, 'Series': 'S', 'Country': '5260', 'PrevTum': ' ', 'PrevMorph': None, 'PrevTopo': None, 'PrevTreat': None, 'HerDis': None, 'SpecHerDis': None, 'Morph': '1010', 'SpecMorph': None, 'Topo': ' ', 'Immunology': None, 'SpecObs': None, 'Origin': ' ', 'PatientID': None, 'PatientName': None, 'CaseOrder': 1}, {'RefNo': 638, 'CaseNo': '121', 'Sex': 'F', 'Age': 60, 'Race': 'W', 'Series': 'U', 'Country': '5250', 'PrevTum': ' ', 'PrevMorph': None, 'PrevTopo': None, 'PrevTreat': None, 'HerDis': None, 'SpecHerDis': None, 'Morph': '1010', 'SpecMorph': None, 'Topo': ' ', 'Immunology': None, 'SpecObs': None, 'Origin': 'L', 'PatientID': None, 'PatientName': None, 'CaseOrder': 121}, {'RefNo': 763, 'CaseNo': '1', 'Sex': 'F', 'Age': 2, 'Race': None, 'Series': 'S', 'Country': '5190', 'PrevTum': ' ', 'PrevMorph': None, 'PrevTopo': None, 'PrevTreat': None, 'HerDis': '110', 'SpecHerDis': '+21', 'Morph': '1010', 'SpecMorph': None, 'Topo': ' ', 'Immunology': None, 'SpecObs': None, 'Origin': ' ', 'PatientID': None, 'PatientName': None, 'CaseOrder': 1}]

